    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/50cb2011400b508a73067e7e040a6315.avif?t=1705068168\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br>sCATch 2 is a puzzle game where the objective is find the exit after paint all the wall of the maze with the right colors and using the items with different mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/666b3cf5d99bc1a9b97d630e31e8e7c2.poster.avif?t=1705068168\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/666b3cf5d99bc1a9b97d630e31e8e7c2.webm?t=1705068168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/666b3cf5d99bc1a9b97d630e31e8e7c2.mp4?t=1705068168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>- 40 levels;<br>- Different mechanics;<br>- Original chiptune 8-bits soundtrack;<br>- 8-bits Pixel Art;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/99ea874111441a9b59b12a3abf61e110.poster.avif?t=1705068168\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/99ea874111441a9b59b12a3abf61e110.webm?t=1705068168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719730/extras/99ea874111441a9b59b12a3abf61e110.mp4?t=1705068168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
